<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Mashar Announcement</title>
    <style>
        * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
        body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background: #F4F6FB; color: #1F2937; padding: 24px; }
        .container { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; background: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 14px; overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid #E5E7EB; }
        .header { background: #1F3A8A; color: #FFFFFF; padding: 28px 32px; text-align: center; }
        .header h1 { font-size: 22px; margin-bottom: 8px; }
        .header p { font-size: 14px; color: #D1D5DB; }
        .content { padding: 30px 32px; }
        .greeting { font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 16px; }
        .message { font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.75; color: #374151; margin-bottom: 22px; }
        .cta { text-align: center; margin: 28px 0; }
        .cta a { display: inline-block; background: #1F3A8A; color: #FFFFFF; text-decoration: none; padding: 14px 26px; border-radius: 8px; font-weight: 600; }
        .note { font-size: 13px; color: #6B7280; line-height: 1.6; }
        .footer { background: #F9FAFB; padding: 20px 32px; font-size: 13px; color: #6B7280; }
        .footer a { color: #1F3A8A; text-decoration: none; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="header">
            <h1>Mashar Alumni Update</h1>
            <p>Something new has been added to your alumni community.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="content">
            <p class="greeting">Hi <strong><%= name %></strong>,</p>
            <p class="message">✨ New update: <strong><%= message %></strong></p>
            <div class="cta">
                <a href="<%= actionLink %>">View the update</a>
            </div>
            <p class="note">Stay connected with the latest from Mashar Alumni.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="footer">
            <p>Mashar Alumni Network</p>
            <p><a href="https://mashar.org">mashar.org</a></p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
